    {
      "id": 45,
      "at": [
        -4,
        -14
      ],
      "text": "A/D and D/A converters (ideal). Top: a 20 Hz sine into a 4-bit ADC and back through a 4-bit DAC; the\nscope shows the input and the 16-step staircase. Bottom: drag V3 and VM1 follows in 8-bit steps of\n5 V / 256 = 19.5 mV. Replace them with the 10- or 12-bit converters for finer steps."
    }
  ]
